# BLE 自动重连能力调研报告

以下基于 `/Users/jace/Documents/newapp` 仓库只读探查，按 8 个问题逐一回答。

---

## 1. `core_ble` 公开 API 与状态模型

### `BleService`（抽象传输层）

路径：`/Users/jace/Documents/newapp/packages/core/core_ble/lib/src/service/ble_service.dart`

```6:47:/Users/jace/Documents/newapp/packages/core/core_ble/lib/src/service/ble_service.dart
abstract class BleService {
  Stream<BleDevice> scan({required Duration timeout});
  Future<Result<BleConnection>> connect(String deviceId);
  Future<Result<void>> disconnect(String deviceId);
  Stream<BleConnectionState> get connectionState;
  Future<Result<bool>> isAvailable();
}

abstract class BleConnection {
  String get deviceId;
  Future<Result<List<int>>> readCharacteristic(...);
  Future<Result<void>> writeCharacteristic(..., {bool withoutResponse = false});
  Stream<List<int>> notifyCharacteristic(...);
}
```

### `FlutterBlueBleService`（默认实现）

路径：`/Users/jace/Documents/newapp/packages/core/core_ble/lib/src/impl/flutter_blue_ble_service.dart`

公开方法与 `BleService` 一致，额外有私有 `_onNativeConnectionState` / `_emitConnectionState`。`connect` 使用 `autoConnect: false` + **15 秒**超时：

```100:133:/Users/jace/Documents/newapp/packages/core/core_ble/lib/src/impl/flutter_blue_ble_service.dart
  Future<Result<BleConnection>> connect(String deviceId) async {
    try {
      final device = BluetoothDevice.fromId(deviceId);
      _emitConnectionState(BleConnectionState.connecting);
      await device
          .connect(autoConnect: false)
          .timeout(const Duration(seconds: 15));
      // ...
    } on TimeoutException { /* ble.connect_timeout */ }
    on Object catch (e) { /* ble.connect_failed */ }
  }
```

### `BleSessionController`（会话层）

路径：`/Users/jace/Documents/newapp/packages/core/core_ble/lib/src/service/ble_session_controller.dart`

```18:157:/Users/jace/Documents/newapp/packages/core/core_ble/lib/src/service/ble_session_controller.dart
final bleSessionProvider =
    NotifierProvider<BleSessionController, BleSessionState>(BleSessionController.new);

class BleSessionController extends Notifier<BleSessionState> {
  BleConnection? get connection => _useVendorChannel ? null : _connection;
  bool get useVendorChannel => _useVendorChannel;

  Future<Result<void>> connect({required String deviceId, String? deviceName});
  Future<Result<void>> disconnect();
  Future<Result<void>> sendVendorCommand(List<int> frame);
}
```

`build()` 中订阅 `ble.connectionState` 并写回 `state.connectionState`（vendor 通道时跳过）。

### `BleConnectionState` 枚举

路径：`/Users/jace/Documents/newapp/packages/core/core_ble/lib/src/model/ble_models.dart`

```38:50:/Users/jace/Documents/newapp/packages/core/core_ble/lib/src/model/ble_models.dart
enum BleConnectionState {
  disconnected,
  connecting,
  connected,
  disconnecting,
}
```

### `BleSessionState` 字段

路径：`/Users/jace/Documents/newapp/packages/core/core_ble/lib/src/model/ble_session_state.dart`

```4:55:/Users/jace/Documents/newapp/packages/core/core_ble/lib/src/model/ble_session_state.dart
class BleSessionState {
  const BleSessionState({
    this.connectionState = BleConnectionState.disconnected,
    this.deviceId,
    this.deviceName,
    this.lastError,
  });

  final BleConnectionState connectionState;
  final String? deviceId;
  final String? deviceName;
  final String? lastError;

  bool get isConnected => connectionState == BleConnectionState.connected;

  String get statusLabel {
    return switch (connectionState) {
      BleConnectionState.connected => deviceName ?? deviceId ?? 'Connected',
      BleConnectionState.connecting => 'Connecting…',
      BleConnectionState.disconnecting => 'Disconnecting…',
      BleConnectionState.disconnected => 'Not connected',
    };
  }
  // copyWith(...)
}
```

**结论：没有**区分「用户主动断开」vs「意外断线」的字段（无 `disconnectReason`、`userInitiated` 等）。意外断线时 `FlutterBlueBleService._onNativeConnectionState` 只会 emit `disconnected`，`BleSessionController` 也不会保留 `deviceId`（`disconnect()` 会 `clearDevice: true`）。

