## 2. 「断开连接」按钮调用链路

**唯一 UI 入口**：`DeviceConnectPage` 中已连接设备的 `OutlinedButton`。

路径：`/Users/jace/Documents/newapp/packages/feature/device/feature_device_connect/lib/src/pages/device_connect_page.dart`

```36:37:/Users/jace/Documents/newapp/packages/feature/device/feature_device_connect/lib/src/pages/device_connect_page.dart
    final controller = ref.read(deviceConnectControllerProvider.notifier);
```

```88:91:/Users/jace/Documents/newapp/packages/feature/device/feature_device_connect/lib/src/pages/device_connect_page.dart
                onDisconnect: connectState.status ==
                        DeviceConnectStatus.disconnecting
                    ? null
                    : controller.disconnect,
```

```249:256:/Users/jace/Documents/newapp/packages/feature/device/feature_device_connect/lib/src/pages/device_connect_page.dart
                if (isConnected) ...[
                  Expanded(
                    child: OutlinedButton(
                      onPressed: isBusy ? null : onDisconnect,
                      child: isBusy && !isConnecting
                          ? _ButtonSpinner()
                          : Text(l10n.disconnectButton),
```

**完整链路**：

```
DeviceConnectPage._DeviceCard.onDisconnect
  → DeviceConnectController.disconnect()          [device_connect_controller.dart]
    → BleSessionController.disconnect()           [ble_session_controller.dart]
      → BleService.disconnect(deviceId)           [flutter_blue_ble_service.dart]
        → BluetoothDevice.disconnect()            [flutter_blue_plus]
```

`DeviceConnectController.disconnect()`：

```110:116:/Users/jace/Documents/newapp/packages/feature/device/feature_device_connect/lib/src/controller/device_connect_controller.dart
  Future<void> disconnect() async {
    if (state.isBusy) return;
    state = state.copyWith(status: DeviceConnectStatus.disconnecting);
    await ref.read(bleSessionProvider.notifier).disconnect();
    state = state.copyWith(status: DeviceConnectStatus.idle, clearError: true);
  }
```

`BleSessionController.disconnect()` 会 `clearDevice: true`，清空 `deviceId`/`deviceName`。

**注意**：`disconnect()` **不会** bump `manualConnectGenerationProvider`（只有 `connect(source: manual)` 会 bump）。另有一处非用户按钮的断开：`DeviceIdentitySyncController` 在设备信息握手失败 2 次后会调用 `bleSessionProvider.notifier.disconnect()`（`/Users/jace/Documents/newapp/packages/feature/device/feature_device_connect/lib/src/controller/device_identity_sync_controller.dart:125`）。

