## 3. `feature_device_connect` 各 Controller/Provider 职责

### `DeviceConnectController`

管理 `DeviceConnectPage` 的手动连接/断开，只跟踪 in-flight 操作（connecting/disconnecting/error），真实连接态读 `bleSessionProvider`。

```32:108:/Users/jace/Documents/newapp/packages/feature/device/feature_device_connect/lib/src/controller/device_connect_controller.dart
class DeviceConnectController extends Notifier<DeviceConnectState> {
  Future<void> connect({
    required String deviceId,
    String? deviceName,
    DeviceConnectSource source = DeviceConnectSource.manual,
  }) async {
    if (source == DeviceConnectSource.manual) {
      ref.read(manualConnectGenerationProvider.notifier).bump();
    }
    // 权限检查 → bleSessionProvider.notifier.connect() → recordConnected/Failure
  }
  Future<void> disconnect() async { /* 见上 */ }
}
```

### `DeviceAutoConnectController`

App 启动时**尝试一次**自动连接最近已知设备，最多 **6 次**、间隔 **5 秒**（可 override）。`state == true` 表示本会话已尝试过，不会再次触发。

```14:56:/Users/jace/Documents/newapp/packages/feature/device/feature_device_connect/lib/src/controller/device_auto_connect_controller.dart
class DeviceAutoConnectController extends Notifier<bool> {
  Future<void> tryOnce() async {
    if (state || ref.read(bleSessionProvider).isConnected) return;
    state = true;
    // 取 connectedDevicesProvider.first → preflight → 重试循环
    final manualGeneration = ref.read(manualConnectGenerationProvider);
    for (var attempt = 0; attempt < 6; attempt++) {
      if (ref.read(bleSessionProvider).isConnected ||
          ref.read(manualConnectGenerationProvider) != manualGeneration) {
        return;
      }
      await ref.read(deviceConnectControllerProvider.notifier).connect(
        deviceId: device.deviceId,
        deviceName: device.name,
        source: DeviceConnectSource.autoConnect,
      );
      if (ref.read(bleSessionProvider).isConnected ||
          ref.read(manualConnectGenerationProvider) != manualGeneration) {
        return;
      }
      await Future<void>.delayed(ref.read(autoConnectRetryDelayProvider));
    }
  }
}
```

代码注释明确写了：`// ponytail: ... use a background reconnect service only when product needs all-day reconnect.`

### `manualConnectGenerationProvider`

递增计数器，用于**取消进行中的自动连接重试循环**：

```18:30:/Users/jace/Documents/newapp/packages/feature/device/feature_device_connect/lib/src/controller/device_connect_controller.dart
final manualConnectGenerationProvider =
    NotifierProvider<_ManualConnectGenerationController, int>(
      _ManualConnectGenerationController.new,
    );

class _ManualConnectGenerationController extends Notifier<int> {
  @override
  int build() => 0;
  void bump() { state++; }
}
```

**机制**：`tryOnce()` 开始时 snapshot `manualGeneration`，每次循环前检查 `ref.read(manualConnectGenerationProvider) != manualGeneration`，若用户手动 `connect()` 触发了 `bump()`，循环立即 `return`。

测试证据：`connected_devices_test.dart` 中 `'manual connect stops pending auto-connect retries'`（`/Users/jace/Documents/newapp/packages/feature/device/feature_device_connect/test/connected_devices_test.dart:352`）。

### `autoConnectRetryDelayProvider`

```10:12:/Users/jace/Documents/newapp/packages/feature/device/feature_device_connect/lib/src/controller/device_auto_connect_controller.dart
final autoConnectRetryDelayProvider = Provider<Duration>(
  (_) => const Duration(seconds: 5),
);
```

