## 4. `DeviceAutoConnectGate` 包裹与触发时机

路径：`/Users/jace/Documents/newapp/apps/glasses_app/lib/app.dart`

`_GlassesRoot` 用 `DeviceAutoConnectGate` 包裹 `MaterialApp.router`：

```351:393:/Users/jace/Documents/newapp/apps/glasses_app/lib/app.dart
class _GlassesRoot extends ConsumerWidget {
  @override
  Widget build(BuildContext context, WidgetRef ref) {
    // ...
    return DeviceAutoConnectGate(
      child: MaterialApp.router(
        title: 'Glasses App',
        // ...
      ),
    );
  }
}
```

`DeviceAutoConnectGate` 实现（同文件包内 controller）：

```111:141:/Users/jace/Documents/newapp/packages/feature/device/feature_device_connect/lib/src/controller/device_auto_connect_controller.dart
class DeviceAutoConnectGate extends ConsumerStatefulWidget {
  const DeviceAutoConnectGate({required this.child, super.key});
  final Widget child;
}

class _DeviceAutoConnectGateState extends ConsumerState<DeviceAutoConnectGate> {
  @override
  void initState() {
    super.initState();
    WidgetsBinding.instance.addPostFrameCallback((_) {
      if (!mounted) return;
      ref.read(deviceAutoConnectControllerProvider.notifier).tryOnce();
    });
  }

  @override
  Widget build(BuildContext context) {
    ref.watch(deviceIdentitySyncControllerProvider);  // 顺带 eager-init 身份同步
    return widget.child;
  }
}
```

**触发时机**：App 根 Widget 首帧渲染后（`addPostFrameCallback`），**仅一次**。没有 `AppLifecycleState` 前台/后台监听，也没有 BLE 断线后再触发。

