## 8. 其它 Feature 的重试循环参考

### A. `DeviceAutoConnectController`（最接近目标，但仅限启动时）

见上文 §3。固定 5s 间隔、最多 6 次、manual generation 取消。

### B. `feature_interpretation` — WebSocket 断线重连（指数退避）

路径：`/Users/jace/Documents/newapp/packages/feature/ai/feature_interpretation/lib/src/controller/interpretation_controller.dart`

```51:53:/Users/jace/Documents/newapp/packages/feature/ai/feature_interpretation/lib/src/controller/interpretation_controller.dart
  static const _kMaxReconnects = 5;
  var _reconnectAttempts = 0;
```

```687:744:/Users/jace/Documents/newapp/packages/feature/ai/feature_interpretation/lib/src/controller/interpretation_controller.dart
  Future<void> _scheduleReconnect() async {
    _reconnectAttempts++;
    if (_reconnectAttempts > _kMaxReconnects) { /* 放弃，设 error */ return; }
    final delaySecs = (1 << (_reconnectAttempts - 1)).clamp(1, 32);  // 指数退避 1/2/4/8/16/32s
    state = state.copyWith(status: InterpretationStatus.connecting, clearError: true);
    await Future.delayed(Duration(seconds: delaySecs));
    if (_disposed || _stopping) return;
    try {
      _socket = await WebSocket.connect(...).timeout(const Duration(seconds: 15));
      _reconnectAttempts = 0;
      state = state.copyWith(status: InterpretationStatus.running);
    } catch (e) {
      await _scheduleReconnect();  // 递归重试
    }
  }
```

BLE 断线时**不重连 BLE**，而是停止同声传译：

```670:674:/Users/jace/Documents/newapp/packages/feature/ai/feature_interpretation/lib/src/controller/interpretation_controller.dart
  void _handleBleSessionChanged(BleSessionState? prev, BleSessionState next) {
    if (prev?.isConnected == true && !next.isConnected && state.isLive) {
      unawaited(_handleBleDisconnected());
    }
  }
```

### C. `feature_glasses_object_recognition` — 预览流自动重连（线性退避）

路径：`/Users/jace/Documents/newapp/packages/feature/ai/feature_glasses_object_recognition/lib/src/controller/object_recognition_controller.dart`

```14:19:/Users/jace/Documents/newapp/packages/feature/ai/feature_glasses_object_recognition/lib/src/controller/object_recognition_controller.dart
